        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>More Jump</strong>&quot; is a platform jumping game. I pay tribute to &quot;Jump King&quot; and &quot;Angry Birds&quot;. The game requires extremely strong skills and patience. A slight mistake may force you to start over. We never think it's a mistake if you don't reach the top. Because the phrase &quot;do my best&quot; already shows your courage to move forward. You have actually won against yourself. Of course, we encourage you to reach the top. In this way, you will not only prove your gaming skills but also recognize your efforts in life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game operation is very simple: just control the slime's angle and force with the mouse, and release it to make the slime jump. Although the operation is simple, the prediction of the jumping angle and landing point for each step is extremely important. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Just hold your body and you can jump. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.The difficulty increases in each level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Time and again, falling down</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>More Jump</strong>&quot; is a platform jumping game. I pay tribute to &quot;Jump King&quot; and &quot;Angry Birds&quot;. The game requires extremely strong skills and patience. A slight mistake may force you to start over. We never think it's a mistake if you don't reach the top. Because the phrase &quot;do my best&quot; already shows your courage to move forward. You have actually won against yourself. Of course, we encourage you to reach the top. In this way, you will not only prove your gaming skills but also recognize your efforts in life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game operation is very simple: just control the slime's angle and force with the mouse, and release it to make the slime jump. Although the operation is simple, the prediction of the jumping angle and landing point for each step is extremely important. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Just hold your body and you can jump. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.The difficulty increases in each level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Time and again, falling down</p>",
        "short_description": "Every grip is a rebellion against fate. The top holds the only secret method to defeat the demon king, but the path there is paved with countless falls. We pay tribute to every challenger. Reaching the end, you win the dawn of the world; and every attempt, you have already won your own dawn.",
